      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is deeply painful when the advice you receive feels dismissive of the intense reality you are experiencing. The pain of a profound loss can feel permanent, and feeling that struggle is pointless is a very heavy burden to carry. If you are having thoughts of self-harm, please call or text 988 immediately to connect with someone who can truly listen and help you through this crisis.",
